# Default: the mobile app is the web/frontend maintainer's area, so the
# web team is auto-requested for review alongside the project lead when
# someone else opens a PR here. This is review-request (tagging) only,
# not enforcement -- develop requires 0 reviews and no code-owner review,
# so maintainers self-merge their own PRs; the hard gate is at main
# (promotion is lead-only, org-enforced). Safety-critical and release
# paths below re-assert lead ownership (last match wins).
